{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_062370861cdd5ab35fbf58fed6e8452a2a3f7cc7c6a508654d41a0e560dbd1d2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b41e9a67b31c036f88a77455f3eb98b8d66d3b6c0fa15b69f634dce641eb709c"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The session map renders subagent genealogy: real delegations (task tool, child sessions, workflow fan-out) fork into their own lanes attributed to the subagent, with lanes named by role distilled from the spawn type or task prompt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_12f13c80794a1a8f93e670803b6f658f767eed577946354ecad0dd24403b93f9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_751072f40d8346621fd2c305ce0281a4a48d5d203474617fb1c17ea1a4c455d6"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Post-compaction re-reads currently fall back to being served in full rather than as diffs; keeping a local content cache to enable diff-serving across compaction is listed as future work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6a60365ebcd502faa2e53d437e4669f664236f85a8aeebaba5f803b8ce390fe9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4c690be734b741bb39995afaaadcffecd131e9914b4e3ee27342833a0be94d2f","slc_e179358a3f97e55eede9ab256d74844dd7bb6304f60e4a926093bbeb73e361e6"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Repository development practice: to build from source, clone the repo, run npm install and npm run build:cli, then run node packages/cli/dist/cli.js; development checks use npm run check (typecheck + tests) and npm run build.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a794377b2bad8343a8c4f35d9f365e6276afdf23ccb509ca0976e56b8852d2c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bd58e69375014aae5ac1990a902f4313c7889cf251c08feb3f7c83a5e47dbaa6","slc_d0d1107e6f0b14aa5fcf3a702008be0015fa95805856da83b2fb2d3c6ad20561"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Scoring is task-tailored: a task archetype (research/debug/ops/feature/edit) conditions the efficiency score, a separate effectiveness score judges whether the task landed, and scores are baselined against the user's past runs of the same kind in the same project.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b1f68b8b8ba845459519310f48fdf548e93370e821f479c6f46c9b3564af049e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4013874410600f4a5f9790e2506c44b047b4b56568cae40a9cbfde9a66fd7594","slc_a28f1e7a62b1dca12e8e1f945127ec1b71e8ceba049555ceab11aea2585a80f0"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The tool is local-first with no API key: traces stay on the machine, raw prompts, secrets, and file contents are redacted by default, and even model-based suggestions receive only a redacted digest (metric statuses, counts, file basenames, command verbs).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b5f198f73dc0088679c14b48dd4f4ebfa98971f00ea5553189d2d0e128094d29","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b4ab7a4c080fd50a4d424feb9bfb8493236dc372bbecba6fdfa7538c66fde743","slc_ef10647e456254fb115931341b0f43c4ae18e02ef3d7a7bbe20454125671afb1"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The repository is organized into packages/core (canonical TraceEvents, graph, redaction, replay, audit, handoff, efficiency engine), host adapters for claude-code, codex, and opencode, apps/daemon, and apps/dashboard.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c2decc638fa2562d9d676a11a312c10a4ae8196c9a15982679078f16dfc2384b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4013874410600f4a5f9790e2506c44b047b4b56568cae40a9cbfde9a66fd7594","slc_4c037daea87bc442537bd024353512bc476d15b44870b684771ee8b123fa8772"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The stated philosophy is to derive truth from observed events rather than the agent's self-report, with every node being an event the agent actually emitted (read, edit, command with exit code, delegation).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cd6f5e3869d695a55f7581f2edd1457452d9643bc2504a975c96126fd306a15d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6d36faeebe65c564780cfbd5795c1a9d61c1ad23ae0847eb1026493ee226c32e","slc_836eb2181befe1a7fe71804137bcdef24eab77ce43a3e7ba2929b9d16e137997","slc_e6662ea7a50c6a98beaf6f7921e9f4cf49662dac51087bb0d1756ac9ee0460d2","slc_fcabf1fc69b2b822f689a4880085213d2ae3a5cdbdb0a6ba03859d4ff148226c"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The quickstart requires Node 20+; suggestion tailoring can use a free/local model (Ollama, any OpenAI-compatible localhost server, OpenCode's free models) with no API key, while rule-based suggestions work with no dependencies by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d95179693433f6e4cc8ecf5a778323fab8dcd762bd93956618b0893fc385c61b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5de92ae9c4b3619b9662f97d0f680b37c6612e829cedf6b1f337a5e489c08f48"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Agent-Blackbox is described as a local-first flight recorder and context-efficiency profiler for coding agents, rebuilding each run as a live, replayable operational graph from observed events rather than the agent's own summary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e39737b91b6e09ba70fe7c58c1a642d25d0bced4601545e00e4799ab2fb39a19","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_482447a939ef624ba367fc9a89c87801657c863e0c470de13f3122bfd3103b93"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"The daemon exposes an HTTP/WebSocket API including POST /events, GET /graph?seq, GET /snapshot, GET /audit, GET /efficiency, POST /suggest, GET/POST /optimize[/apply|/revert], GET /handoff, and WS /stream for live snapshots.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e4e0abd88e8e672d33d44eb30180af85aaf23c46b913889314c15c7498028a0c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_54ec1f60a96784d8288131bb8965b1231f6a6f08db90fd1cbbe7685482517ba5"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Per-project state lives under <project>/.agent-blackbox/ (optimization.json, efficiency-profile.json, optional rules.json), with cross-run baselines stored as baselines.json next to the daemon's event store.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e829cadecbc23b4c288b514c7f1eb8d3e15fedbcdf3909832860ce1579cde254","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3db211ee6d101766baad7c7708c6b3d643e9dc2577289134ba24d875e96ad67e","slc_691a834e4470e4d5fe4a6fdddf58e7e32fdae2d84a8c12025f2bbf22df5666b8"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"An opt-in in-run optimizer (AGENT_BLACKBOX_OPTIMIZE=1 or --install --optimize) serves re-reads as a no-op or diff via OpenCode tool hooks, never blocking re-reads and only firing when no compaction has occurred since the file was last served.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f49202013566048b84cd714605fd918c9620197862d786968d930348f88e0cd2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"taewooopark/agent-blackbox@bc0d72aeb7bd snapshot 04a1eb49ea1e68ba","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2889d43891651e622dad135805d4bc8ae9c3d70eb31f89945d7d3c7f39a089cb","slc_2d9386b88d70980c697530503d6191854559dc4b5af4f0a7b211eee173c6bc86"],"source_ids":["src_87511458ed385af19711913115392a41"],"text":"Each run receives a context-efficiency score computed from observed sizes and token snapshots, covering metrics like context pressure, cache hit ratio, redundant re-reads, read amplification, retry waste, and yield density.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f331900b781e49dda0ab76141d9147c4"}
